WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,940
What? It’s only been three days since I got married and my parents went behind my back to exchange for a luxurious house.

2
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,640
Great aunt is back Great aunt is back

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The girl is finally back. The master has been reading about it since morning.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,200
Mother Zhou

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,000
The girl has been out for a few days and she doesn’t even recognize the old slave anymore.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,530
This isn't the first time I've come here to recognize a student.

7
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:28,330
Could it be that you still don’t know about moving?

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:46,940
I have been so busy these past two days that I even forgot about moving to the center of the country.

9
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,740
Dad Mom

10
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:51,240
Just come back
